\f4\fs26 Shakti walked onto the floor of stage 3. The crowd was already revved up and they were cheering and screaming in their seats.\
\'93Management Class of the Primary Trade Dominion, I have great news. Today a reign of terror came to an end. Over the past 12 years, the Nightclub Vampire has been raping and murdering young girls, but more recently two L.5\'92s were victims to his crimes most foul.\'94 The crowd roared with outrage at the news that two noble girls were victims of this working class phenomena. \'93Today I arrested Anthony Hardy, Cleaner, L.2 for those crimes.\'94 The audience cheered long and loud.\
\'93He attempted escape and was shot down, shot down like the dog that he is.\'94 Shakti faltered and was now shaking, his best friend was dead and falsely accused, by him. \'93The Nightclub Vampire is dead\'85.\'94 He was drowned out by the howls, yahoos and wolf-whistles that burst forth from the crowd. \'93\'85.we cannot bring him before you tonight, but we have the footage of the shooting. Roll the file.\'94 Shakti managed to paste a smile over his sorrow.\
A giant vid screen behind him erupted into life. It was security footage, but of reasonable quality, albeit from a considerable distance. The stunning blonde, pulled out her gun and without hesitation, shot the vampire point blank in the chest. This pleased the studio audience immensely who continued to wolf whistle and howl with delight. They were further impressed when the uniformed sergeant plugged him a couple of more times, but burst into fits of hysterical laughter when the blonde knocked him flying. \
\'93Good on you, darling,\'94 A lone voice was heard above the crowd.\
At home, safely tucked away in his plush penthouse apartment, Haloren Smyth, Director, L.6 was watching his favourite show, Candid Criminal, intently. \'93What the fuck? What the FUCK? Cracker, given credit for my work?\'94 He waved his right hand and the hologram of the idiot Shakti disappeared. He gathered up his \'93kit-bag\'94 and headed for the door. \'93Time for a fucking crime-spree.\'94 
